sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant A as AppState
    participant S as FinanceStore
    participant D as Encrypted SQLite
    participant C as SyncClient
    participant API as Sync API
    participant PG as PostgreSQL

    U->>A: Save a transaction
    A->>S: post journal
    S->>D: BEGIN IMMEDIATE
    S->>D: Write journal, postings and search index
    S->>D: Insert outbox command (same transaction)
    S->>D: COMMIT (WAL, synchronous FULL)
    S-->>A: Saved
    A-->>U: Show entry as unsynced
    C->>D: Read pending outbox batch (up to 500)
    C->>API: POST /v1/sync/commands
    API->>PG: One transaction: idempotency record, entity, change log
    API-->>C: Per-command results
    C->>D: Mark applied, conflict or rejected
    C->>API: GET /v1/sync/changes?cursor=...
    API-->>C: Changes, new cursor, hasMore
    C->>D: Apply changes and cursor in one transaction
    C-->>A: Refresh
